                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. 1. Permanent Position—A permanent position is one which has been established by the Board with the anticipation that it will be necessary to maintain the existence of such position indefinitely on a continuous year-round or school-year basis.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                404,
                734,
                501
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    404.0
                ],
                [
                    734.0,
                    404.0
                ],
                [
                    734.0,
                    501.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    501.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Conditional Position—A conditional position is one established by the Board for the period of time that monies are available in whole or in part from the United States Government, a private organization, a foundation, a revenue-producing source, or an individual for use in special research or other long-term projects. This position shall be automatically abolished when no longer needed or when funds are no longer made available.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                513,
                735,
                660
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    735.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    735.0,
                    660.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    660.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Full-time and Part-time Positions—Permanent and conditional positions may be either full-time or part-time. A full-time position is one requiring no less than twenty (20) work hours per week. A part-time position is one requiring less than twenty (20) work hours per week.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                671,
                735,
                771
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    671.0
                ],
                [
                    735.0,
                    671.0
                ],
                [
                    735.0,
                    771.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    771.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. 1. Definition of a Temporary Position—A temporary position is one not continuous in nature and established for a period normally not to exceed six (6) months.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                781,
                735,
                854
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    781.0
                ],
                [
                    735.0,
                    781.0
                ],
                [
                    735.0,
                    854.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    854.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. A temporary position which has been extended or reestablished more than one time for periods totaling twelve (12) months within a consecutive thirty (30) month period will be included in the superintendent's yearly budget as a permanent position.",
            "block_bbox": [
                118,
                866,
                736,
                964
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
